OL,3,AScientists 'stunned' by children's lung
OL,4,Arecovery in ultra low emission zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists say they have been "stunned"
OL,7,Fby how quickly young children's lungs
OL,8,Fbegan to recover and grow after
OL,9,Fpollution restrictions were brought in
OL,10,Fwhere they lived.
OL,12,FResearchers found that children in
OL,13,FLondon whose lung growth had been
OL,14,Fstunted by pollution showed impressive
OL,15,Fimprovements after the introduction of
OL,16,Fan Ultra Low Emission Zone (Ulez) in
OL,17,F2019 reduced emissions.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
