OL,3,AScientists 'stunned' by children's lung
OL,4,Arecovery in ultra low emission zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe study followed more than 3,400
OL,7,Fprimary school children in London and
OL,8,FLuton and provides what scientists
OL,9,Fbelieve is the strongest evidence yet
OL,10,Fthat local clean air zones could help
OL,11,Freduce some of the harm caused by
OL,12,Fpollution during childhood.
OL,14,FBut independent researchers caution
OL,15,Fthat other factors must also be
OL,16,Fconsidered.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
